              "category": "orders",
              "description": "Classify emails as Orders when the sender wants to place a new order or discusses an existing order, including order confirmation, order status, tracking, delivery, cancellation, modification, returns, or refunds.  Examples: - I want to order two products. - Please confirm my order. - What is the status of my order? - I want to cancel my order. - My order has not been delivered yet. - I want to request a refund for my order."
            },
            {
              "category": "Inquiry ",
              "description": "Classify emails as Inquiry when the sender is asking questions or requesting general information about products, services, pricing, availability, features, specifications, business details, or support before making a purchase.  Examples: - What is the price of your product? - Do you have this product in stock? - Can you share more details about your services? - What are your business hours? - Do you provide home delivery?"
            },
            {
              "category": "others",
              "description": "Classify emails as Others when they do not belong to Inquiry or Orders.  This includes newsletters, promotional emails, advertisements, spam, job applications, partnership proposals, general notifications, personal messages, and unrelated communications.  Examples: - Subscribe to our newsletter. - We are hiring developers. - Check out our latest promotional offer. - Congratulations on your achievement. - Let's discuss a potential partnership."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
